    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "8.某中学的同学们设计了下面的方法检测教室的房梁是否水平："
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        147,
        314,
        739,
        333
      ],
      "reading_order": 5,
